== diagnostics ==
E0201 [Error] 773..774 expected `{` or `then` after the `if` condition
    secondary 778..779 this `{` is on the next line
    note an `if` is written `if c { a } else { b }`, or on one line `if c then a else b` — braces or `then`, never neither, and both branches the same way ([gram.expr.if])
    note a newline after the header's last token ends the statement ([gram.lex.newline]), so the `{` on the line below opens a block of its own, not this one. The opening brace goes on the header's line ([gram.fmt.brace]); a header that runs over several lines breaks after an operator (`a &&` / `b {`).
    help [MachineApplicable] put the `{` at the end of the header's line
